==== POD: poc-vault-secretless-run-demo-pod ====
==== STEP step-fetch-from-vault ====
[fetch-from-vault] 1) 读取 Pod 自己的 SA projected token
  SA token length=1198
[fetch-from-vault] 2) 调 auth/kubernetes/login 换 vault client_token
  got vault client_token length=95
[fetch-from-vault] 3) 直接 HTTP GET 读 secret/data/git/test 拿真实 PAT
[fetch-from-vault] 4) 把 PAT 物化到 workspace 文件（Vault 模式必经动作）
-rw-------    1 root     65532           32 May 22 04:27 /workspace/shared/.git-token
[fetch-from-vault] done. token bytes written: 32

==== STEP step-use-token ====
+ WS=/workspace/shared
+ echo '===== [use-token] A. cat 文件即得明文 PAT ====='
+ cat /workspace/shared/.git-token
+ echo
+ echo '===== [use-token] B. env 注入路径（Vault Agent 典型用法）====='
+ cat /workspace/shared/.git-token
+ TOK=ghp_FAKE_PAT_for_demo_only_12345
+ export 'GIT_TOKEN_FROM_ENV_DEMO=ghp_FAKE_PAT_for_demo_only_12345'
+ env
+ grep -iE 'token|secret|vault'
+ echo '===== [use-token] C. 拼 URL（真实泄漏到 process args/log）====='
+ echo 'git clone https://oauth:ghp_FAKE_PAT_for_demo_only_12345@gitea.example.com/foo/bar.git'
+ echo '===== [use-token] D. ps -ef 抓进程 args 也带 token ====='
+ sleep 0.2
+ sh -c 'exec -a fake-git-with-secret-ghp_FAKE_PAT_for_demo_only_12345 sleep 1'
sh: exec: line 0: sleep: not found
