===== [use-token] D. ps -ef 抓进程 args 也带 token =====
+ ps -ef
+ grep fake-git
   26 root      0:00 grep fake-git
===== [use-token] 结论: Vault 模式下 client 容器对原始 PAT 完全可见 =====
+ wait
+ echo '===== [use-token] 结论: Vault 模式下 client 容器对原始 PAT 完全可见 ====='
